theorem k215UnpairAt2329Step9Z (a b c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt2329State k215PNum2329 a b 0 c) = (k215UnpairAt2329State k215PNum2337 a b 0 c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair2329_2329) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet2_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifpos eqid));

