theorem k215UnpairAt2329Step11S (a b n c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt2329State k215PNum2331 (suc a) b n c) = (k215UnpairAt2329State k215PNum2332 a b n c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair2329_2331) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet6_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifneg peano1)) (k215PStateeq2 (eqtr (k215PSeteq2 (subeq1 k215PGet6_vector)) (eqtr k215PSet6_vector (k215PVectoreq7 (eqtr subSS sub02))))));

